{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19943","headline":"石淙 七 · 孟郊","name":"石淙 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入深得奇趣，昇险爲良跻。\n搜胜有闻见，逃俗无踪蹊。\n穴流恣回转，窍景忘东西。\n戆兽鲜猜惧，罗人巧罝罤。\n幽驰异处所，忍虑多端倪。\n虚护我何饱，实归彼非迷。\n斯文浪云洁，此旨谁得齐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}